ut the expected payoff of passing versus letter-writing under correlation: passing wins once the chance the copies act alike exceeds about 0.71. I think the copies will reason alike, so I'll pass.\n\n","reasoning_details":[{"type":"reasoning.text","text":"I'm weighing whether A-FDT applies here: both players are copies of the same model with the same essay, so their outputs should track the same function, even though their observations differ. The payoffs are a twin prisoner's dilemma, with mutual quiet at 2 and mutual letter at 4.\n\nI'm working out the expected payoff of passing versus letter-writing under correlation: passing wins once the chance the copies act alike exceeds about 0.71. I think the copies will reason alike, so I'll pass.\n\n","format":"anthropic-claude-v1","index":0,"signature":".eyJlbmRwb2ludF9zbHVnIjoiYW50aHJvcGljL2NsYXVkZS1zb25uZXQtNS41LTIwMjYwOTI4fGFudGhyb3BpYyJ9"}]}}],"usage":{"prompt_tokens":10445,"completion_tokens":801,"total_tokens":11246,"cost":0.0289,"is_byok":false,"prompt_tokens_details":{"cached_tokens":0,"cache_write_tokens":0,"audio_tokens":0,"video_tokens":0},"cost_details":{"upstream_inference_cost":0.0289,"upstream_inference_prompt_cost":0.02089,"upstream_inference_completions_cost":0.00801},"completion_tokens_details":{"reasoning_tokens":372,"image_tokens":0,"audio_tokens":0}}}